 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Love doing it yourself and sharing it with friends. A beer box with pencils, tats and box of small snacks. Or a brewer with rare and exotic beans. The recipient can be your surprise. A box with ingredients is also lovely. Roughly £40-50 for a good 1 pound of beer and ingredients. Keep it hidden until you ready and then pop it on a table or in the kitchen. People love it. It' great way to show you thought of them without buying another thing.",
